[268.359402, "o", "\u001b[1mindex 521b3e9..53231e3 100755\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m--- a/docs/README.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m+++ b/docs/README.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36m@@ -7,11 +7,13 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mgo build -o bin/clinicops ./cmd/clinicops\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n bin/clinicops agenda   --clinic bristol --date 2026-11-17 [--clinician cl-ruiz]\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n bin/clinicops sync-ehr --clinic cork --date 2026-11-17\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n bin/clinicops overlaps\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mbin/clinicops remind [--now RFC3339]\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n go test ./...\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n ```\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n Records are read from `$CLINIC_DATA` (default `./data`). Exit codes: `0` ok, `1` error,\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m-`64` usage.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`64` usage. `remind` exits `3` if any SMS send fails (and continues with the other\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mappointments).\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n ## Data\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36m@@ -48,3 +50,23 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mvalue at that path in `vars` (nested objects; any keys the template does not use\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n"]
[268.359414, "o", " A placeholder with no value makes Relaywave reject the message. `internal/render` implements the\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n same placeholder rules, so a template can be checked local"]
[268.359644, "o", "ly against the `vars` you are about\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n to send. `to` must be E.164. `reference` comes back on delivery receipts.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m## Appointment reminders\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mRun `clinicops remind` from cron every 15 minutes. `--now RFC3339` pins the clock\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mfor a replay or test. It sends SMS reminders for booked appointments starting in\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`(now, now + 24 hours]` when the patient has SMS consent and a phone number, and\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32monly between 08:00 (inclusive) and 21:00 (exclusive) in each appointment clinic's\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mtime zone. Quiet-hour reminders wait until an eligible daytime run; appointments\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mthat have already started are never reminded.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mRelaywave receives the clinic's `sms_template` with nested `patient`, `appointment`,\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`clinician` and `clinic` records in `vars`, plus `appointment.starts_local` (for\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mexample, `"]
[268.359659, "o", "Tue 17 Nov, 09:30`). No local template export is required.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mSuccessful deliveries are saved in `$CLINIC_DATA/reminders_sent.json`, keyed by\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mappointment ID and start instant, so moving an appointment to a new start makes it\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32meligible again. Keep this file between runs. Failed sends are not recorded and\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n:\u001b[K\r\u001b[K\u001b[7mCannot edit standard input  (press RETURN)\u001b[27m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[K\r\u001b[K\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mwill be retried on the next eligible run. A `reminders_sent.lock` file serializes\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n:\u001b[K\r\u001b[K\u001b[7mNo next tag  (press RETURN)\u001b[27m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[K\r\u001b[K:\u001b[K\r\u001b[K:\u001b[K.\b.\r\u001b[K/\u001b[K.\b.\u001b[K.\b.\u001b[K.\b.\u001b[K;\b;\u001b[K \b \u001b[Kg\bg\u001b[Ko\bo\u001b[K \b \u001b[Kt\bt\u001b[Ke\be\u001b[Ks\bs\u001b[Kt\bt\u001b[K \b \u001b[K-\b-\u001b[Kr\br\u001b[Ka\ba\u001b[Kc\bc\u001b[Ke\be\u001b[K \b \u001b[K.\b.\u001b[K/\b/\u001b[K.\b."]
[268.35971, "o", "\u001b[K.\b.\u001b[K.\b.\r\u001b[K"]
[268.359916, "o", "\u001b[1;1H\u001b[1m--- a/docs/README.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2;1H\u001b[1m+++ b/docs/README.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[3;1H\u001b[36m@@ -7,11 +7,13 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mgo build -o bin/clinicops ./cmd/clinicops\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4;1H bin/clinicops agenda   --clinic bristol --date 2026-11-17 [--clinician cl-ruiz]\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5;1H bin/clinicops sync-ehr --clinic cork --date 2026-11-17\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6;1H bin/clinicops overlaps\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mbin/clinicops remind [--now RFC3339]\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[8;1H go test ./...\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[9;1H ```\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[10;1H \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[11;1H Records are read from `$CLINIC_DATA` (default `./data`). Exit codes: `0` ok, `1` error,\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[12;1H\u001b[31m-`64` usage.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[13;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`64` usage. `remind` exits `3` if any SMS send fails (and continues with the other\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[14;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mappointments).\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[15;1H \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[16;1H ## Data\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[17;1H \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[18;1H\u001b[36m@@ -48,3 +50,23 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mvalue at that path in `vars` (nested objects; any keys the template does not use\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[19;1H A placeholder with no value makes Relaywave reject the messag"]
[268.359972, "o", "e. `internal/render` implements the\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[20;1H same placeholder rules, so a template can be checked locally against the `vars` you are about\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[21;1H to send. `to` must be E.164. `reference` comes back on delivery receipts.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[22;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[23;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m## Appointment reminders\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[24;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[25;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mRun `clinicops remind` from cron every 15 minutes. `--now RFC3339` pins the clock\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[26;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mfor a replay or test. It sends SMS reminders for booked appointments starting in\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[27;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`(now, now + 24 hours]` when the patient has SMS consent and a phone number, and\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[28;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32monly between 08:00 (inclusive) and 21:00 (exclusive) in each appointment clinic's\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[29;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mtime zone. Quiet-hour reminders wait until an eligible daytime run; appointments\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[30;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mthat have already started are never reminded.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mRelaywave receives the cl"]
[268.359981, "o", "inic's `sms_template` with ne"]
[268.360119, "o", "sted `patient`, `appointment`,\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`clinician` and `clinic` records in `vars`, plus `appointment.starts_local` (for\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mexample, `Tue 17 Nov, 09:30`). No local template export is required.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[35;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mSuccessful deliveries are saved in `$CLINIC_DATA/reminders_sent.json`, keyed by\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mappointment ID and start instant, so moving an appointment to a new start makes it\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32meligible again. Keep this file between runs. Failed sends are not recorded and\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[39;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mwill be retried on the next eligible run. A `reminders_sent.lock` file serializes\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[40;1H\u001b[1;1H\u001b[1m--- a/docs/README.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2;1H\u001b[1m+++ b/docs/README.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[3;1H\u001b[36m@@ -7,11 +7,13 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mgo build -o bin/clinicops ./cmd/clinicops\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4;1H bin/clinicops agenda   --clinic bristol --date 2026-11-17 [--clinician cl-ruiz]\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5;1H bin/clinicops sync-ehr --clinic cork --date 2026-11-17\u001b"]
[268.360135, "o", "[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6;1H bin/clinicops overlaps\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mbin/clinicops remind [--now RFC3339]\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[8;1H go test ./...\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[9;1H ```\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[10;1H \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[11;1H Records are read from `$CLINIC_DATA` (default `./data`). Exit codes: `0` ok, `1` error,\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[12;1H\u001b[31m-`64` usage.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[13;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`64` usage. `remind` exits `3` if any SMS send fails (and continues with the other\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[14;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mappointments).\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[15;1H \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[16;1H ## Data\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[17;1H \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[18;1H\u001b[36m@@ -48,3 +50,23 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mvalue at that path in `vars` (nested objects; any keys the template does not use\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[19;1H A placeholder with no value makes Relaywave reject the message. `internal/render` implements the\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[20;1H same placeholder rules, so a template can be checked locally against the `vars` you are about\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[21;1H to send. `to` must be E.164. `reference` comes back on delivery receipts.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[22;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[23;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m## Appointment reminders\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b"]
[268.360143, "o", "[24;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[25;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mRun `clinicops remind` from cron every 15 minutes. `--now RFC3339` pins the clock\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[26;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mfor a replay or test. It sends SMS reminders for booked appointments starting in\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[27;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`(now, now + 24 hours]` when the patient has SMS consent and a phone number, and\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[28;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32monly between 08:00 (inclusive) and 21:00 (exclusive) in each appointment clinic's\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[29;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mtime zone. Quiet-hour reminders wait until an eligible daytime run; appointments\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[30;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mthat have already started are never reminded.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mRelaywave receives the clinic's `sms_template` with nested `patient`, `appointment`,\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32m`clinician` and `clinic` records in `vars`, plus `appointment.starts_local` (for\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mexample, `Tue 17 Nov, 09:30`). No local template export is required.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[35;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36;1H\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mS"]
